## Cross-repo coordination

When changing API contract in repo A:
1. Update consumers in repos B, C in same MR/PR series
2. Merge order: schema/types repo first, then producers, then consumers
3. Run tests in each affected repo separately
4. Don't merge breaking change without consumer updates ready

If unsure which repos consume the API → ask user before changing.

